K_{reduced} = \sqrt{\left(\rho \cdot \sum_{c} SCVA_c\right)^2 + \left(1 - \rho^2\right) \cdot \sum_{c} SCVA_c^2}

[Math] Formula for the capital requirement under the reduced version of the BA-CVA, K_reduced, expressed as a function of the systemic correlation parameter rho and the counterparty-level SCVA values summed over all counterparties c within scope of the CVA charge.
K_{reduced} = \sqrt{\left(\rho \cdot \sum_{c} SCVA_c\right)^2 + \left(1 - \rho^2\right) \cdot \sum_{c} SCVA_c^2}

K_{full} = \beta \cdot K_{reduced} + \left(1 - \beta\right) \cdot K_{hedged}

[Math] Formula for full version capital requirement for CVA risk, expressed as a weighted sum of K_reduced and K_hedged with supervisory parameter beta.
K_{full} = \beta \cdot K_{reduced} + \left(1 - \beta\right) \cdot K_{hedged}

K_{hedged} = \sqrt{\left(\rho \cdot \sum_{c}(SCVA_c - SNH_c) - IH\right)^2 + \left(1 - \rho^2\right)\sum_{c}(SCVA_c - SNH_c)^2 + \sum_{c}HMA_c}

[Math] Formula for the part of capital requirements recognising eligible hedges, involving summations over all counterparties c within scope of the CVA charge.
K_{hedged} = \sqrt{\left(\rho \cdot \sum_{c}(SCVA_c - SNH_c) - IH\right)^2 + \left(1 - \rho^2\right)\sum_{c}(SCVA_c - SNH_c)^2 + \sum_{c}HMA_c}

K = m_{CVA} \cdot \sqrt{\sum_b K_b^2 + \sum_b \sum_{c \neq b} \gamma_{bc} \cdot K_b \cdot K_c}

[Math] Aggregate capital charge K across buckets, scaled by the CVA multiplier m_CVA, with cross-bucket correlations gamma_bc.
K = m_{CVA} \cdot \sqrt{\sum_b K_b^2 + \sum_b \sum_{c \neq b} \gamma_{bc} \cdot K_b \cdot K_c}

